    <sys:String x:Key="M.Trial.Differs">A try run is not a service run: it uses your account, your environment and your desktop. A service runs as LocalSystem unless an account is given, sees only machine-level environment variables, has no mapped network drives and no desktop. Write paths as %BASE%\… or absolute, and put anything the program needs into &lt;env&gt;, so the two agree.</sys:String>

